# Third-party dependencies for source-tree SDK tests on Python 3.12.
#
# `iroha-norito` and `iroha-torii-client` are imported from their sibling
# source trees in tests/conftest.py, so they intentionally do not appear here.
# Keep these ranges aligned with the three local pyproject.toml files.
#
# Regenerate from the repository root with Python 3.12 and pip-tools 7.6.0:
#   python3.12 -m piptools compile --generate-hashes --resolver=backtracking \
#     --strip-extras --output-file python/iroha_python/requirements-ci.lock \
#     python/iroha_python/requirements-ci.in

